  "prefLabel": "Nuh 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 9 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 151-A:3. The board is made up of 4 licensed nursing home administrators, 4 members selected from other professions and institutions concerned with the care of chronically ill and infirm aged patients and one member who is a representative of the general public with no direct financial interest in any nursing home.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nuh100-500.html"
